# Scratch/test databases and reports — real test runs should use
# OPSDB_PATH pointed outside the repo (e.g. /tmp), but this is defense
# in depth in case one ever lands here by mistake. See ops/db/README.md.
ops/db/test*.sqlite3
ops/db/*.test.sqlite3
ops/db/*.CURRENT_STATUS.md
ops/db/*.overview.html
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Founder credential file (Milestone 2B4) — never committed. Wildcard
# also covers founder_auth.py's atomic-write temp file, which shares the
# same dot-prefixed .founder_credential stem. See
# ops/reviews/cto-milestone2b4-architecture.md §3/§13 and
# ops/control-center/founder_auth.py.
ops/control-center/.founder_credential*
